flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Admin Login]
    B -->|Invalid| C[Show Login Error]
    C --> B
    B -->|Valid| D[Dashboard]
    D --> E{Choose Action}
    E -->|Register| F[Store Student Details]
    F --> G[Capture 50-100 Face Images]
    G --> D
    E -->|Train| H[Read Dataset]
    H --> I[Train and Save LBPH Model]
    I --> D
    E -->|Take Attendance| J[Open Webcam]
    J --> K[Detect Face with Haar Cascade]
    K --> L{Known Face?}
    L -->|No| M[Display Unknown]
    L -->|Yes| N{Already Marked Today?}
    N -->|No| O[Save Present Attendance]
    N -->|Yes| P[Display Already Present]
    M --> J
    O --> J
    P --> J
    E -->|View/Export| Q[Search SQLite Records / Write CSV]
    Q --> D
    E -->|Exit| R([End])
